"{\"blocks\":[{\"k\":\"t\",\"v\":\"Two Turkish award options depart SFO on January 8 and arrive in Bangkok at the same time. The business option leaves earlier; the economy option has a shorter elapsed journey.\"},{\"k\":\"p\",\"r\":\"J115@2027-01-08T08:40-08:00/SFO>BKK/B>2027-01-10T08:50\",\"n\":\"Turkish business award via LAX\",\"v\":\"Consider this if the reported business cabin and 8:40 a.m. departure suit you. It arrives at the same time as the economy option, with a 7-hour connection in Istanbul.\"},{\"k\":\"p\",\"r\":\"J18@2027-01-08T11:47-08:00/SFO>BKK/E>2027-01-10T08:50\",\"n\":\"Turkish economy award via LAX\",\"v\":\"Consider this if economy suits you and a later departure with a shorter journey is preferable: it leaves 3 hours 7 minutes later, arrives at the same time, and has 187 minutes less elapsed time. Its Turkish quote is 110,000 points, versus 275,000 for business; both point quotes have unknown scope.\"},{\"k\":\"t\",\"v\":\"Both options need a separate SFO–LAX cash flight and an LAX award ticket. The award records do not provide a tax amount or reliable seat-count evidence, and do not establish support for your party. The separate-ticket and positioning arrangements are unverified. The positioning fares are quoted at USD 59 and USD 109, respectively, but their price scope is unknown; these figures and the point quotes therefore do not establish a complete trip cost.\"},{\"k\":\"b\",\"r\":\"C1@2027-01-08T06:05-08:00/SFO>BKK\",\"n\":\"Cash itinerary reference\",\"v\":\"The SFO–BKK cash itinerary was quoted at USD 452.00; its price scope is unknown.\"}]}"
